\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Test accuracy versus Mapping~S energy per sample (optimistic corner) for the accuracy-oriented (filled) and energy-oriented (hollow) hyperparameters. The dashed line is the accuracy and energy front, and ringed points are its members. Unringed points near the line are dominated by less than 0.05 points. Energy includes the controller. The axes are cut to the front region. Below the cut lie the 200-clause vanilla TM of both datasets (78.65\% and 81.22\%) and the accuracy-oriented 2-clause NSL-KDD FPTM (84.11\%).}}{35}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:front}{{3}{35}{\wosnew {Test accuracy versus Mapping~S energy per sample (optimistic corner) for the accuracy-oriented (filled) and energy-oriented (hollow) hyperparameters. The dashed line is the accuracy and energy front, and ringed points are its members. Unringed points near the line are dominated by less than 0.05 points. Energy includes the controller. The axes are cut to the front region. Below the cut lie the 200-clause vanilla TM of both datasets (78.65\% and 81.22\%) and the accuracy-oriented 2-clause NSL-KDD FPTM (84.11\%).}}{figure.3}{}}
